WEBVTT

00:01.395 --> 00:03.611
AI CV Studio: Your CV in another language.

00:03.611 --> 00:07.523
Open your CV

00:07.523 --> 00:11.400
Tap Translate

00:11.400 --> 00:15.134
Choose the language

00:15.134 --> 00:19.041
Your name, dates and numbers never change

00:19.041 --> 00:22.551
Check it beside the original, then save a new CV

00:22.551 --> 00:25.358
Free to start: Apply in any language.
